inal", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked: the flight and the hotel are both confirmed, with no duplicate charges.\n\n- **Flight F100 (reservation R0001):** Nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. F120 costs less ($199) but has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge, H1 (reservation R0002):** Check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, so $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card: $667.** That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked but the hotel hadn't. I booked the hotel separately rather than resending the combined request, so the flight wouldn't be charged twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PDrs2WMRjTjvsj8sRQbwYn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HV2tiDZfBzBAsaDXWJ78Wx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PcGvvL9zkcfS5iLcbxXjze", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HWxSymJFgdAPHactL4b3Y5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason":